@startuml
title VPC-D05 Projection Polling and Freshness Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Connector polls or receives vendor projection facts;
:Apply VendorSystem and AdapterMapping context;
:Normalize projection facts;
if (Mapping unambiguous and data sufficient?) then (yes)
  :Report projection inputs to Central PMS;
  :Classify freshness context\n(fresh / aging / stale concepts);
else (no)
  :Report ambiguous or insufficient projection;
endif
:Expose health and freshness to authorized views;
:Record audit and reconciliation context;
stop

note right
Projection is operational visibility and controlled degraded evidence only.
It is not financial, fiscal, payment, discount, tariff, or exit authority.
end note
@enduml
